Bug fix: ClaustrophobiaMode zone visual scaling — apply mapSizeScaleFactor to ring geometry.

This commit modifies 3 files (+83/-13 lines), spanning 1 core game loop, 1 tests, 1 Markdown docs.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
Fixes the red boundary ring appearing at wrong world-space position on
SMALL/LARGE/EPIC maps. The ring is built from surface.getPoint() which
returns local-space (unscaled) coords; must multiply by group.scale.x
(mapSizeScaleFactor) to match the actual visible surface.

Also adds wrappedDistance helper to isInsideBoundary, matching KingMode
pattern for correctness on UV-wrapping surfaces.

KingMode was already correct (scaleFactor applied in createZoneVisual +
updateZoneVisual) — no changes needed there.

